  "operative_text": "Section 13519.11 (Penal Code): The commission shall develop and implement, on or before January 1, 2022, a course of training regarding gun violence restraining orders issued pursuant to Chapter 4 (commencing with Section 18170) of Division 3.2 of Title 2 of Part 6. In developing the training, the commission shall consult with members of law enforcement and the community who have expertise in the areas of gun violence and gun violence restraining orders.\nSection 13519.11 (Penal Code): (2) Situational training to assist officers in identifying when a gun violence restraining order is appropriate. (3) How law enforcement can respond effectively to situations that might necessitate a filing for a gun violence restraining order."
}